{"type":"FeatureCollection","municipality_code":"29450","pref":"奈良県","city":"下北山村","display_comment":"下北山村には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 まずは社寺・地域信仰に目を向けると、地域の由緒をたどる手がかりが見つけやすいでしょう。 現地では石碑、地蔵、地域資料館、公民館の由緒板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 ゆかりの人物では杉岡華邨に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「吉野熊野国立公園」や「前鬼（ぜんき）」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","layer_counts":{"public_facilities":10,"scenic_nature_areas":4,"cultural_facilities":6,"tourism_resources":2},"total_features":22,"features":[{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"小井公民館","category":"public","address":"下北山村下桑原365","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"29450","municipality_pref":"奈良県","municipality_name":"下北山村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[135.9757168,34.02247962]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"桑原公民館","category":"public","address":"下北山村上桑原440","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"29450","municipality_pref":"奈良県","municipality_name":"下北山村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[135.9817274,34.00314479]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"浦向生活改善センター","category":"public","address":"下北山村浦向68","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"29450","municipality_pref":"奈良県","municipality_name":"下北山村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[135.9551234,34.001775]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"寺垣内コミュニティセンター","category":"public","address":"下北山村寺垣内806","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"29450","municipality_pref":"奈良県","municipality_name":"下北山村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[135.9525467,34.00623063]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"池峰公民館","category":"public","address":"下北山